sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as GPU worker caller
    participant Runner as GPUModelRunner
    participant State as DeepseekV41ModelState
    participant Wrapper as DeepseekV41 wrapper
    participant Text as V4.1 text model
    participant Layer as Decoder layer
    participant Attn as DeepseekV4Attention
    participant Compressor as DeepseekCompressor
    participant Indexer as Sparse indexer
    participant Cache as GPU cache ops
    participant Backend as FlashMLA / FlashInfer / Mega
    participant Sampler as GPU sampler

    Caller->>Runner: SchedulerOutput with scheduled token rows
    Runner->>Runner: Update request state and build InputBatch and slot mappings
    Runner->>State: prepare_attn(input_batch, KV groups)
    State-->>Runner: Attention metadata and optional replay metadata
    Runner->>Wrapper: model_inputs (IDs, positions, optional embeddings)
    opt Image tokens present
        Wrapper->>Wrapper: ViT + aligner, then merge image embeddings
    end
    Wrapper->>Text: forward(input_ids, positions, inputs_embeds)
    loop Each decoder layer
        Text->>Layer: Hidden state and mHC stream state
        Layer->>Attn: Normalized attention input and positions
        Attn->>Cache: Prepare Q and write layer-local SWA KV
        opt KV-source layer
            Attn->>Compressor: Compress KV/score state
            Compressor-->>Attn: BF16 latent
            Compressor->>Cache: RoPE, quantize, and store compressed KV
        end
        opt Index-source layer
            Attn->>Indexer: Prepare index Q and publish K if also KV source
            Indexer->>Cache: Score candidates and write shared top-k buffer
            Indexer-->>Attn: Shared selected positions
        end
        alt SM12 FlashInfer
            Attn->>Backend: Q + selected global KV (if compressed) + SWA cache
            Backend-->>Attn: Sparse attention output
        else Eligible SM100 Mega
            Attn->>Backend: Q + selected global KV (if compressed) + SWA cache
            Backend-->>Attn: Fused attention and quantized output
        else FlashMLA sparse fallback
            Attn->>Backend: Q + selected global KV (if compressed) + SWA cache
            Backend-->>Attn: Sparse attention output
        end
        Attn-->>Layer: Grouped output projection
        Layer->>Layer: mHC boundary and MoE FFN
        Layer-->>Text: Updated hidden/residual streams
    end
    Text-->>Wrapper: Collapsed, normalized hidden states
    Wrapper-->>Runner: Model output
    Runner->>Text: compute_logits(selected hidden rows)
    Text-->>Runner: Vocabulary logits
    Runner->>Sampler: Sample next token
    Sampler-->>Runner: Sampled token IDs
    Runner->>Runner: Postprocess request state and stage async output
    Runner-->>Caller: AsyncOutput / ModelRunnerOutput
